  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya land spirit classes it as a cultivation assistance Immortal Gu for soul path Gu Immortals.",
        "chapters": [
          663
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Its refining effect is far greater than Wolf Soul Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          664
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_wolf_soul_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It is the core Gu of the immortal killer move myriad self. That move forms strength path phantoms that carry a trace of Fang Yuan’s soul, so he can direct them as extensions of his body, at the cost of soul foundation.",
        "chapters": [
          663
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "With myriad self, his battle strength reaches a first-rate rank six Gu Immortal level; without it, he rates himself below ordinary rank six Gu Immortals.",
        "chapters": [
          664
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
